{"id": "city-college-appropriations-limit-carryforward", "title": "City College understated its adjusted appropriations limit by $23.9 million", "seconds": 47.2, "voice": "tinyvoca:F2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "3f480d6a4588b537", "words": 130, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "California gives each community college an annual spending limit on certain tax revenues.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.11, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["How", "a", "limit", "was", "misstated"], "sub": "Nonresident enrollment changed the calculation", "source": "first"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "City College counted nonresident students in one population calculation.", "t0": 5.23, "t1": 9.28, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "first", "kicker": "Nonresident enrollment changed the calculation", "text": "The enrollment factor", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The auditors said that understated the adjusted limit by $814,064.", "t0": 9.4, "t1": 14.67, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "first", "layout": "table", "heading": "Population factor", "context": "FY2014 audit", "rows": [{"label": "Filed", "value": "0.7850"}, {"label": "Revised", "value": "0.7885"}, {"label": "Adjusted limit understated", "value": "$814,064"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The next audit found a different problem with the starting figure.", "t0": 14.89, "t1": 17.95, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "next", "kicker": "The revised base was missing from the next state filing", "text": "The following year", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The prior year had been revised, but that revision had not carried forward.", "t0": 18.07, "t1": 22.13, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "next", "kicker": "The revised base was missing from the next state filing", "text": "The missed carryforward", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The base was understated by about $25.7 million.", "t0": 22.25, "t1": 26.27, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "next", "layout": "table", "heading": "One state form", "context": "Understated limit", "rows": [{"label": "Section I.A base", "value": "$25,720,287"}, {"label": "Section I.D adjusted limit", "value": "$23,907,019"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "After inflation and population adjustments, the limit was understated by about $23.9 million.", "t0": 26.39, "t1": 32.47, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "next", "kicker": "The revised base was missing from the next state filing", "text": "The adjusted limit", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "These are two lines on the same 2015 worksheet.", "t0": 32.59, "t1": 35.43, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "next", "layout": "table", "heading": "Two steps", "context": "FY2015 form", "rows": [{"label": "Section I.A", "value": "Base"}, {"label": "Section I.D", "value": "Adjusted limit"}]}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The college stayed within its limit, and the auditors questioned no costs.", "t0": 35.55, "t1": 39.36, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "next", "kicker": "The district stayed within its limit", "text": "No questioned costs", "mark": "No"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The 2016 audit reported that the recommended correction was implemented.", "t0": 39.58, "t1": 43.73, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "closed", "kicker": "The FY2016 audit recorded implementation", "text": "The next audit", "mark": "The"}}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 43.85, "t1": 46.32, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}}], "audioStatus": "temporary-local", "audioProvider": "tiny-voca", "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Nonresident enrollment changed the calculation", "b": "The revised base was missing from the next state filing", "o": "The FY2016 audit recorded implementation"}, "look": "map", "hook": "person"}